---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";

const title = "About the Lohen Genshin Guide: Data, Sources & Standards";
const description =
  "Why this Lohen Genshin guide exists, who maintains it, and how build, mechanic, and material advice is verified against official sources and in-game testing.";
const canonical = "https://www.lohen-genshin.com/about/";
---

<Layout title={title} description={description} canonical={canonical}>
  <main class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4 pb-24 pt-32 sm:px-6">
    <p class="overline">About</p>
    <h1 class="mt-4 text-4xl sm:text-5xl">The guide behind the guide</h1>
    <div class="mt-8 space-y-5 text-base leading-relaxed text-stone-300">
      <p>
        Lohen Genshin Guide is a fan-made, single-page reference for one character in Genshin
        Impact: Lohen, the Vice Captain of the Knights of Favonius Fifth Company and a 5-star Cryo
        polearm DPS. It exists because the pages that rank for "Lohen" are sprawling wiki entries,
        paywalled build guides, or top-up shops using leaked info to sell Primogems. We built the
        opposite.
      </p>
      <p>
        Everything lives on one page so a player who searches for Lohen gets the full picture at
        once — who he is, whether to pull, how to build him, his story, and every material he needs
        — without ten tabs or a login wall.
      </p>
      <h2 class="mt-10 text-2xl">How the data is verified</h2>
      <p>
        Build recommendations follow official skill descriptions from HoYoverse and the 6.6 beta
        kit, cross-checked with community testing on HoYoLAB. Damage multipliers, constellation
        uplift, and energy requirements are cross-checked against live in-game tests at C0 and C1
        and re-reviewed as new versions land.
      </p>
      <h2 class="mt-10 text-2xl">Editorial standards</h2>
      <ul class="list-disc space-y-2 pl-5">
        <li>No affiliate top-up links, no ad walls, no paywalled sections.</li>
        <li>Sources are linked inline where a figure comes from a specific test.</li>
        <li>Speculative content is labeled as community testing, never stated as fact.</li>
        <li>Update dates are shown on every page so readers can judge freshness.</li>
      </ul>
      <p class="mt-8 text-sm text-stone-500">
        This site is not affiliated with or endorsed by HoYoverse or miHoYo. All game assets and
        trademarks belong to their respective owners.
      </p>
    </div>
  </main>
</Layout>
